  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **√**1st number : **[**(√1st number) + 1]2 + 1 = 2nd number.\n\nNow,\n\nFor, 289 : 325\n\n⇒ √289 = 17.\n\n⇒ [(√289) + 1]2 + 1\n\n⇒ (17 + 1)² + 1\n\n⇒ (18)² + 1 \n\n⇒ 324 + 1 = 325.\n\nSimilarly, for **361 : ? **\n\n**⇒ √361 = 19.**\n\n**⇒ [(√361) + 1]2 + 1**\n\n**⇒ (19 + 1)2 + 1**\n\n**⇒ (20)2 + 1 **\n\n**⇒ 400 + 1 = 401.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
